"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025, September to October came in at 47% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value, and January to February at 51%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 29856 down at 52% that year.</p>"}
